build/
pleb-plant-grower
*.o
*.a
*.pyc
__pycache__/
core
render_*.ppm

# The SFX bank is a build product: tools/gen_sfx.py regenerates it
# byte-for-byte from integer arithmetic, and docs/audio-provenance.json
# is the artifact of record that `make check-sfx` gates against. The
# WAVs themselves would be 600 KB of binary that git cannot diff and
# that the manifest already pins.
assets/sfx/*.wav

# The three procedural atlases are build products for the same reason
# the SFX bank is: tools/gen_art.py makes them byte-for-byte from
# integer arithmetic, and `make art-check` gates them against it.
assets/graphics/atlases/ui-skin.png
assets/graphics/atlases/glyphs.png
assets/graphics/atlases/particles.png
